      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists and groups just feel like more things to manage. it's just more noise. the truth is i'm just tired of the pattern. it's like i'm fighting a war i've already lost. everything just feels pointless and heavy. what's the point of even waking up to do it all over again tomorrow?",
